{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/008-fu-yi/wangli-yundu","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/008-fu-yi/wangli-yundu/data.json","title":"詩經韻讀 · 芣苢 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 周南 · 芣苢 · 汇集《詩經韻讀》关于《芣苢》的 4 条 annotation，含 4 条 gloss。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"008-fu-yi","materialId":"wangli-yundu"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/008-fu-yi/wangli-yundu","poem":{"id":"008-fu-yi","title":"芣苢","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"zhounan","path":["風","周南","芣苢"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"采采芣苢","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"薄言采之","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"薄言有之","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"薄言掇之","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"薄言捋之","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"薄言袺之","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"薄言襭之","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"wangli-yundu","title":"詩經韻讀","authors":["王力"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 王力","era":"现代","publicationYear":1980,"carrier":"PDF"},"stats":{"annotationCount":4,"glossCount":4},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"《芣苢》韵读段","targetNotes":"书页 140 上整个韵读说明。","sourceLabel":"第 140 页局部","sourceNotes":"/tmp/fuyi-pages/wangli-148.png 正对整段注音与注释。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","text":"整段沿用本书的韵读格式：先以“采采芣苢(jia)”起句，继列“薄言采(tsa)之”“薄言有(hiu)之”“薄言掇(tuat)之”“薄言捋(luat)之”“薄言袺(kyet)之”“薄言襭(hyet)之”的拟音与所属部类，供读者辨认《芣苢》各章韵脚。","notes":null}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":4,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"采采芣苢，薄言采之。薄言有之。","targetNotes":"首章段落。","sourceLabel":"第 140 页局部","sourceNotes":"/tmp/fuyi-pages/wangli-148.png 上半段包含三句原文。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","text":"首章收“采采芣苢(jia)”与“薄言采(tsa)之”“薄言有(hiu)之”，两句都归之部，显示王力以同一韵部统摄首章。","notes":null}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":4,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"薄言掇之。薄言捋之。","targetNotes":"第二章韵读。","sourceLabel":"第 140 页局部","sourceNotes":"/tmp/fuyi-pages/wangli-149.png 中段，覆盖第二章的注音。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","text":"第二章续列“薄言掇(tuat)之”“薄言捋(luat)之”，前者旁注“与‘掇’协”，后者旁注“与‘捋’协”，分别标出采摘与捋取时的读法。","notes":null}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":4,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"薄言袺之。薄言襭之。","targetNotes":"第三章韵读。","sourceLabel":"第 140 页局部","sourceNotes":"/tmp/fuyi-pages/wangli-149.png 下段，涵盖末章袺襭二句。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","text":"末章标“薄言袺(kyet)之”“薄言襭(hyet)之”，并在行末标出月、质两部，说明《芣苢》收束两句的读法与韵部分配。","notes":null}]}]}}}
